WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.770
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.440
Everyone, your attention please!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.570
I've have some very important news for you today.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.950
Clear your ears and listen closely.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.790
Approximately three months have passed since your matriculation.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:26.710
We will hold an aptitude test in order to measure your growth.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.880
An aptitude test?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.380
The test will consist of both theoretical and practical parts.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.720
And the top scorers in each class

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.850
will be allowed to perform alongside 
Kasumi Yozora at Summer Fest! {this is actually what he says, but he means 'with their respective S4 member', kind of weird}

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:50.110
If I come in first, I'll be able to form a unit with Yozora-senpai!

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.610
<i>This is the moment I've been waiting for!</i>

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.960
We will now announce the results of the aptitude tests.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:39.880
As you were informed, the top scorer of each class

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:44.100
will be given the chance to form a unit with S4 and perform at Summer Fest.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.930
The shows will be broadcast on Aikatsu TV.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.980
We will begin with Song Class.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.480
The top scorer of Song Class is...

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.610
Please, please, please, please!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.860
Sakuraba Rola.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.120
Here!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.490
N-No way...

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.750
Next, the top scorer of Theater Class.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.040
Saotome Ako.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.130
Here.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.500
The top scorer of Dance Class.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.340
Haruka Luka. {I wouldn't particularly mind Ruka, but her name's also in katakana, so I don't know}{I prefere Luka}

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.760
Here!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:23.260
And finally, the top scorer of Beauty Class.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.300
Kasumi Mahiru.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.060
Here.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.730
These four students will represent their respective classes.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.600
Please step forward.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.520
Yes!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.320
Performances will be held over two days.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.200
Drawings have placed Dance Class and Beauty Class on the first day.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.530
The second day will be Theater Class and Song Class.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.040
Moreover, the unit that takes the top spot

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.540
will be rewarded with a coupon for one full month of free lunches.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:02.550
I now ask each representative to speak a few words.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.430
I will use every ounce of my ability to claim victory!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.930
There is no battle I cannot win.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.560
Therefore, your support is unnecessary.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.810
Haruka's gonna try her very best!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.520
Fighting, fighting!{I wonder what the sc2 scene is like these days}

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.400
I refuse... {this seems better}

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.820
to lose to my sister.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.580
Mahiru-chan.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.330
I didn't expect that kind of thing from Mahiru-chan.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.340
She did tell us how she wanted to surpass Yozora-senpai, but still.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.210
I'm with you.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:46.470
That aside, you're amazing, Rola!
You're gonna be on stage with Hime-senpai!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.970
I am disappointed, but I'm behind you all the way.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.940
Thanks. You can prepare your stomach for when I win that lunch coupon!{to sidestep the need for a lyger hyphen}

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.360
What is it?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.200
I'm so excited for our show I can't help myself!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.610
Are you, now?

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:10.370
So about our song, I was thinking we should do a duet of your most recent one.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.660
What do you think?

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.750
I have no objections.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.790
Then we absolutely have to use matching Romance Kiss dresses.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.710
Their summer theme of Asian Heroine fits perfectly.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.510
I can hardly wait!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.390
Oh, no.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.270
It's time for me to leave for work.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.390
Let's plan to meet again.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.600
Hold on!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.780
Let's invite today's guest onto the set.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:51.200
The first of this week's stage requests, Kasumi Yozora-san. {or maybe she just means first}{I think it's first}

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.790
<i>I've been meaning to see her live for a long time.</i>

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.210
That's a lovely outfit.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.130
It's Romance Kiss's newest dress, the Asian Night Coord.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.340
Shall we jump straight into your performance?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.420
Of course!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.430
I'd love to!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:14.970
<i>Show me the power of S4's Kasumi Yozora.</i>

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.040
Good work out there!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.830
Thank you, and you too.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:41.830
Mahiru?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.460
<b>I'm going home first

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.720
<b>I'm going home first

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.720
<b>I'm going home first

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.010
Time to eat!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.350
It's so delicious!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.640
You really seem to enjoy eating.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.850
Hello.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.560
Did you eat yet? Want to join us?

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.980
I'm not very hungry.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.860
I figured this would do.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.110
Just that?!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.740
Did something happen?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:21.370
I saw my sister working in person and... you know.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.630
But I can't afford to give up.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.630
If I do, all the work I've done so far will go to waste.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.220
So you're set on beating Yozora-senpai at any cost.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:37.010
Yeah, no matter what.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:41.020
Is there a specific reason you're so competitive?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.020
Well...

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.780
Onee-chan and I used to always play together.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.700
We got along so well we were nearly inseparable.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.040
There, finished drawing today's coord.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.420
Wow, it's so cute! Okay, now it's my turn!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.800
How should I color this one?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.680
I think any color you like will end up cute.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.510
I love coloring coords!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.060
But out of nowhere,

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.600
Onee-chan said she was going to apply to Four Star Academy.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.950
She abandoned me and left.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.280
I couldn't stand it.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.460
The reason I became an idol was to show up my sister.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.960
So that's why.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.590
That's why I can't afford to waste time worrying about it here.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.090
I need to work even harder.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.890
Sorry for ranting.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.220
I'll see you later.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.810
<i>Mahiru-chan's forgotten her smile again.</i>

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.360
<i>My goal is to surpass Onee-chan.</i>

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.620
<i>The only way for me to get there is to train!</i>

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.500
<i>I'll show her an amazing performance at our show.</i>

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.500
<i>Just you wait!</i>

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.380
I haven't seen Mahiru around much these days.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.470
Yeah. I think she's training on her own for the show.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.880
I see.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:41.890
I don't think what Mahiru-chan really wants to do is show up her sister.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.780
Not yet... it's still not enough.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.790
Whoa there.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.660
Are you okay?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.290
S-Sorry about that.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.710
Kasumi-san.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.790
Yes?

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.210
A moment.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.550
It's fatigue.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.050
You shouldn't forget to eat and sleep properly.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.310
I'm sorry.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.720
Take it easy for the rest of the day.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.730
Okay...

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:31.560
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.440
<i>Is it really impossible for me?</i>

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.610
I'm coming in.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.650
Please do.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:40.820
Are you all right?!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.580
Onee-chan!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.330
What did you come here for?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.580
With that tongue as sharp as ever, I take it you're fine.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.960
But why did you push yourself so hard in the first place?

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.090
Don't you understand? 
It's all so that I can surpass you!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.760
Mahiru...

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:03.760
I came to Four Star so that I could show you up.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.100
Nothing else matters as long as I can do that!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.480
Just leave me alone!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.410
Wait, Mahiru!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.670
Your sister left these behind.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.000
Here.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.380
It's the same as when you ended up here.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.220
You two are so alike.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.400
Are you sure of this?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.610
Yes.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.820
Understood. You may go.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.200
Thank you.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:12.710
Did you hear? Mahiru-chan dropped out of tomorrow's Summer Fest.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.420
Huh, are you serious?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:16.920
She couldn't have...

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.300
Mahiru-chan? It's Koharu.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.930
Are you in there?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.850
You are, right?

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.100
What do you want?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.190
I heard what you did. Are you sure this is what you want?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:35.900
Yeah.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.820
The thing with Yozora-senpai too?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.570
Yeah.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:45.570
You told us that you came to Four Star
to show up Yozora-senpai.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.160
But that's not how you really feel.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:53.830
The truth is that you applied because you wanted your beloved sister to look at you, to really see you.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.380
Mahiru-chan...

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.090
You must've felt so lonely.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.640
Are you sure you won't regret not letting Yozora-senpai know how you feel?

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.470
Don't act like you know me! {so much teenage angst}{I would say that this is one of those using-too-many-latinate-words things I was talking about by the way, except "act" is also latinate}

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.930
I'm not lonely at all.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.980
And I've never once thought I was either!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.270
Just leave already!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.150
Mahiru-chan...

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.120
Tomorrow's your big show.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.370
You wouldn't want to catch a cold. {do you agree with this, or the [probably] british version of "catch cold"?}{fuck the brits}

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.330
My song was withdrawn.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.960
I might have made a mistake with the way I loved.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.850
There's no wrong way to love.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.390
Especially between two sisters.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.900
Isn't there something you want to tell her?

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.530
Thank you, Hime.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.700
<i>You must've felt so lonely.</i>

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:19.040
<i>Are you sure you won't regret not letting Yozora-senpai know how you feel?</i>

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.170
<i>How am I supposed to tell her that now?!</i>

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:37.940
Since you weren't in your room, I knew I'd find you here.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.190
What are you here for? And at this hour...

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.320
And what's with those clothes? 
Aren't you supposed to be in S4?

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:53.700
That may be so, but before that I'm your sister.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.160
What's with you?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.580
You never cared about me at all!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.340
Don't be nice to me now!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.300
Hey, Mahiru.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:08.840
Look...

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.590
Do you remember this?

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.350
Why... do you...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.270
I thought I threw that away...

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:24.730
It won't be done until you color it.{I guess done/finished is a better example}

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:31.110
Looking at this helps me get through tough times when I'm working.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:36.490
This memory we share gives me strength.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.620
Memory...

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:44.330
I was overjoyed when I found out that you'd be coming to Four Star.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.880
I thought we'd be able to play like we used to.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:53.470
Onee-chan... I've really, this whole time...

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.640
Onee-chan, sor—

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:06.150
I always have, and I always will love you.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.400
I wish we could've talked sooner.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.120
Me too, Onee-chan.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:21.620
Will you draw more coords with me together on the stage?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.920
Yeah!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:28.800
Koharu!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.170
Mahiru-chan.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.090
I'm really sorry about last night!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.430
I'm looking forward to your performance!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:45.810
Thanks!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.320
Hey, party people!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:55.570
It's the first day of Four Star Academy's Summer Fest! {four best girls right here}

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.330
Get ready to get it on!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.910
Dance Class will take the stage first.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:09.290
It's S4's Nikaidou Yuzu and first-year Haruka Luka's special unit!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.670
We'll pump you up with a bang!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:17.300
Our emotions will make it to the farthest reaches of the universe!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:46.000
Next up is a sisters performance from 
Beauty Class's Kasumi Yozora and Mahiru!{the lack of apostrophe is intention}

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:53.380
Let's blind them with our radiance, little sister.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:58.140
So bright, everyone will have to shield their eyes.{what}{isj whatevers}

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.130
Yozora was so much more brilliant than usual!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.720
Yeah, it was a light only those sisters could produce.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.770
Thanks, Mahiru.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:39.980
We couldn't have crafted this performance without you. {I guess there's no S4 summer uniform}

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:42.440
And more importantly, I had a lot of fun!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.910
I didn't know Aikatsu could be this fun.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.160
It feels like all that angst never even happened.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.830
Now I want nothing but to enjoy my Aikatsu.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.290
It's all thanks to you.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.080
Mahiru!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:05.010
But that doesn't mean I don't still want to beat you.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:08.390
I'll keep on challenging you every chance I get.{wow, a proper use of challenge}

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.050
I'll defeat you, Onee-chan! {this matches a sign I did without your guidance last episode}

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:18.560
Bring it on. Hurry up and reach me, Mahiru!

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:03.500
To commemorate my first performance with Mahiru,

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:06.250
we made a portrait of the two of us.

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:08.630
We pulled off an amazing Appeal!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:14.720
Create your own miracle! Felici-Tai! {this isn't what we used}

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:18.470
Please make it in time, Rola!

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:20.310
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.350
Miracle Baton Pass.

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.560
Become the first-star idol!
